{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow-paced, chilled out search &amp; explore detective game inspired by mid 1990s First-person PC game genre. Multiple free roam maps with stores, characters, hidden secrets, make friendships to gain clues that lead to useful &amp; valuable items to help complete side missions and destroy enemies. Collect weapons &amp; various items in your inventory to befriend people or pawn for cash. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is exploration based and sometimes has options for combat. Hidden items and secret side missions can be unlocked by socializing with characters and picking up on clues left by dialogue. Clues are also discovered by searching filing cabinets, boxes, trash bins, and other objects for sticky notes. Various items &amp; tools are required to complete tasks to earn XP and cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cases by searching for clues and/or find evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work undercover and quietly reveal illegal activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam free, outside of missions to explore &amp; discover side missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with NPCs to engage in funny dialogue and uncover new mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a small arsenal available as well as a couple of combat maps</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2678460?t=1757774472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2678460?t=1757774472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757774472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757774472","categories":[{"description"